why An off-hand orb or a staff for your late 30s, down the felhound's or the infernal's path, your pick.

# The Orb of Orahil: Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (4965 Briarthorn,
# Ironforge; 4967 Zevrost, Orgrimmar; 4968 Demisette Cloyce, Stormwind; 4969
# Kaal Soulreaper, Undercity; they exclude each other) to Menara Voidrender in
# Ratchet, and Fragments of the Orb of Orahil (1799). Menara's two acolytes
# then each offer one path, and the game lets you take only one (Shard of a
# Felhound 4962 and Shard of an Infernal 4963 exclude each other, quests.json
# `excl`):
# - felhound: Shard of a Felhound (4962) from Acolyte Wytula, ending with The
#   Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil (4964): the Orb or the Staff of Dar'Orahil;
# - infernal: Shard of an Infernal (4963) from Acolyte Magaz, ending with The
#   Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil (4975): the Orb or the Staff of Noh'Orahil.
# Both share the Infernal Orb for Fragments of the Orb of Orahil (1799),
# Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil (4961) and Returning the Cleansed Orb (4976)
# with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. Once you take one acolyte's quest the
# other's goals show "No longer offered". The two `reward` lines are the two
# ends, each a choice of orb or staff (quests.json: 4964 15106/15108, 4975
# 15105/15107).
# Order matters: hand the demon's spirit to Menara before the Cleansed Orb, or
# the end pays only money and experience (quest notes, player reports).
# Drops and spawns (items.json, npcs.json): the Burning Blade Summoners
# (38-39) carry the Infernal Orb; the felhounds (two Mana Eaters 37-38, eight
# Mage Hunters 38, eight Ley Hunters 39: the Felhas Ruby's targets in the
# quest notes; "a felhound in Desolace" in the quest text) and the Lesser
# Infernals (36-37) of Mannoroc Coven give their spirit when they die
# while the ruby or the emerald is channelled on them. The Demon of the Orb
# (40) is elite; Cleansing has a 3-minute timer that runs on after the kill.
# The Completed Orb's objective is listed as a kill of Menara in the data; it
# is a short wait beside her (quest notes, Classic quest text): do not attack.
# Lint warns that 4963 and 4975 are not offered once 4962 is taken, and 4964
# once 4963 is: both paths in one guide, kept visible, not hidden.
# Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil (4961) lists Shard of a Felhound (4962) as
# well as 1799 before it (quests.json preAll), though 4962 and 4963 exclude
# each other.
# ASSUMED: The infernal path also reaches Tabetha (Classic flow; Forever's data lists 4962 among Cleansing's prerequisites). In-game check: Tabetha offers Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil to a warlock who took Shard of an Infernal.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json, items.json); the quest
# notes (data/local/mechanics) for the channel, the timer and the order.
# Neither reference class guide carries this chain.

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 35 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4968                         -- Demisette Cloyce

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 35 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4965                         -- Briarthorn

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 35 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 35
  accept 4967                         -- Zevrost

step Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 35 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar.
  level 35
