step Menara Voidrender
  zone The Barrens
  tip Menara Voidrender and her two acolytes stand in Strahad Farsan's tower on the hill above Ratchet.
  turnin 4968 only Human              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4965 only Gnome              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4967 only Orc,Troll          -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4969 only Undead             -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 1799

step Choose an acolyte
  tip Pick one acolyte: you can take only one of their quests. Acolyte Wytula's felhound path ends with the Orb or Staff of Dar'Orahil, the shadow versions; Acolyte Magaz's infernal path with the Orb or Staff of Noh'Orahil, much the same items on the fire side. Most warlocks lean on shadow, but compare the four in their tooltips first. The guide follows the one you take. Keep the ruby or the emerald: it is handed back.
  accept 4962                         -- Acolyte Wytula: she gives you the Felhas Ruby
  accept 4963                         -- Acolyte Magaz: he gives you the Infus Emerald

step Mannoroc Coven
  zone Desolace
  tip Mannoroc Coven fills south-central Desolace, east of Shadowprey Village. The Burning Blade Summoners (level 38-39, warlocks with imps) carry the Infernal Orb every time. For the spirit, bring your demon to low health with your damage over time, then channel the ruby or the emerald on it and keep channelling while it dies, as with Drain Soul: the gem does no damage of its own. The ruby works on the coven's felhounds: the two Mana Eaters (37-38) in the north, and the Mage Hunters (38) and Ley Hunters (39) further south. The emerald works on the Lesser Infernals (36-37, sixteen of them, fire-resistant).
  collect 7291 quest 1799.1           -- Infernal Orb, from the Burning Blade Summoners
  collect 12648 quest 4962.1          -- Imprisoned Felhound Spirit, from a Mana Eater, Mage Hunter or Ley Hunter
  collect 12649 quest 4963.1          -- Imprisoned Infernal Spirit, from a Lesser Infernal

step The demon's spirit
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara in the tower above Ratchet with the spirit and the gem first: her orb follows from it.
  turnin 4962                         -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4963                         -- Menara Voidrender

step Tabetha
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Tabetha lives at her farm in the middle of Dustwallow Marsh, south of the road from the Barrens and south-west of Theramore; a spirit healer stands beside it. Deadmire, a level 45 crocolisk, patrols the creeks just north-east. Before you accept Cleansing, clear the spiders and crocolisks around her paddock. Accepting starts a 3-minute timer: she walks to the paddock and lets the Demon of the Orb out. It is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; a warlock of about 40 can solo it with Fear or Banish and damage over time, a level 35-38 one brings a friend. The timer keeps running after the kill, so hand in at once. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it from Tabetha again.
  turnin 1799                         -- Tabetha
  accept 4961
  kill 6549 quest 4961.1              -- Demon of the Orb
  turnin 4961                         -- Tabetha
  accept 4976

step The Orb of Dar'Orahil
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara in the tower above Ratchet with the cleansed orb. On the felhound path, accept her last quest and wait beside her while she completes the Orb of Dar'Orahil (do not attack her: the quest log calls it a kill), then speak to her again and pick the off-hand orb or the staff.
  turnin 4976                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4964
  complete 4964 @62.5,35.4            -- Wait beside Menara while she makes the orb
  turnin 4964 choose 15108 15106      -- Menara Voidrender

step The Orb of Noh'Orahil
  tip On the infernal path, accept her last quest and wait beside Menara while she completes the Orb of Noh'Orahil, then speak to her again and pick the off-hand orb or the staff.
  accept 4975
  complete 4975 @62.5,35.4            -- Wait beside Menara while she makes the orb
  turnin 4975 choose 15107 15105      -- Menara Voidrender
